{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1365-the-list-of-scion-fan-sites","id":1365,"title":"The List of Scion Fan Sites","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-02T16:26:41-07:00","id":1365,"title":"The List of Scion Fan Sites","content":"Herein shall be collected websites, wikis, blogs, livejournals, tumblrs and suchnot where Scion is the primary topic. If you know of a resource or have one that you want added, just post and I'll probably get around to it eventually! <div align=\"center\"><b>-----------------------House Rule Sites-----------------------</b></div> *<a href=\"http://www.thecbg.org/wiki/index.php/Lost_Atlanta\" target=\"_blank\">Lost City of Atlanta Wiki</a> -- Telgar's house rules and system alterations, an in-progress rewrite of everything.<br /> *<a href=\"http://www.thecbg.org/wiki/index.php?title=Modern_Mythos\" target=\"_blank\">Modern Mythos Wiki</a> -- Brent-not-Broken's house rules and campaign information resource.<br /> *<a href=\"http://scionhouserules.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Scion House Rules</a> -- While it doesn't appear to be active anymore, this blog has some interesting and rather radical alterations to Scion's system.<br /> *<a href=\"http://www.rpg-tools.org/generators/index.php?pageId=9&amp;pageType=2\" target=\"_blank\">Scion Quick Reference</a> -- Table-based website that has easy-to-read versions of almost everything. RAW material only.<br /> *<a href=\"http://rolistescools.fr/\" target=\"_blank\">Rolistescools.fr</a> -- A French-language Scion resource with sample adventures.<br /> *<a href=\"http://scion-mmp.wikidot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Monsters and Moshpits</a> -- Large online campaign hub (MUX and MUSH) with various player resources.<br /> *<a href=\"http://rpg-tools.org/scion/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\">James McMurray's Scion Tools</a> -- Online Scion rules reference and campaign site<br /> <div align=\"center\"><b>-----------------------Scion Discussion Blogs-----------------------</b></div> *<a href=\"http://johnsscionresources.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">John's Scion Resources's Blog</a> -- They talk about mythology, history, how to integrate it into Scion, they answer questions about their house rules, about upcoming projects and generally provide their thoughts on things Scion-related.<br /> *<a href=\"http://lostatlanta.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Lost City of Atlanta's Blog</a> -- It started out as a game blog, but now includes general ST advice, Aztec info-dumps and alternate takes on many aspects of Scion's setting and systems. <div align=\"center\"><b>-----------------------Game-Specific Sites-----------------------</b></div> *<a href=\"http://www.obsidianportal.com/campaigns/from-russia-with-ichor\" target=\"_blank\">From Russia with Ichor</a> -- A Scion campaign site, still very much in progress.<br /> *<a href=\"http://www.legendarydeeds.com/wiki/index.php?title=Scion_Washington_DC\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Washington DC</a> -- A Scion chronicle wiki for a game set in Washington, DC.<br /> *<a href=\"http://rpg-tools.org/scion-american-gods/\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: American Gods</a> -- Campaign site including house rules, custom knacks and boons, extra deities and more.<br /> *<a href=\"http://handthatfeeds.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\">When the Levee Breaks</a> -- On-going Scion game with a blog, rules and more.<br /> *<a href=\"http://www.obsidianportal.com/campaigns/the-red-sun\" target=\"_blank\">The Red Sun</a> -- Site for a newly-launched Scion campaign, featuring character list and game writeups..<br /> *<a href=\"http://www.obsidianportal.com/campaigns/scion-taking-it-to-the-titans\" target=\"_blank\">Taking it to the Titans</a> -- Site for an offline game including character journals, game logs, writeups, pictures and more.<br /> *<a href=\"http://fougerec.tripod.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Tick, Tick Boom</a> -- Online campaign with character lists, god portraits, and game write-ups.<br /> *<a href=\"http://scion-dayone.wikidot.com/start\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Day One</a> -- Online campaign with character list and reference material for players.<br /> *<a href=\"http://tideofthunder.wikia.com/wiki/Scion\" target=\"_blank\">Tides of Thunder</a> -- Gemstone's house rules and online game wiki. Only partially in English.<br /> *<a href=\"http://mythic-nights.com/Jove/\" target=\"_blank\">Mythic Nights</a> -- A Scion RP community set in Seattle.<br /> <div align=\"center\"><b>-----------------------In-Character Sites-----------------------</b></div> *<a href=\"http://dj-yomi.livejournal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Erika's LJ</a> -- an in-character LiveJournal for one of the characters in Scion: Petro.<br /> *<a href=\"http://www.obsidianportal.com/campaign/scion-taking-it-to-the-titans/adventure-log/the-whispers-of-the-gods\" target=\"_blank\">Whispers of the Gods</a> -- A directory of several in-character blogs for a chronicle run by Scheherazade.<br /> *<a href=\"http://rhiamissingpieces.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Missing Pieces</a> -- A blog about Aynie's character<br /> <div align=\"center\"><b>-----------------------Semi-Scion Sites-----------------------</b></div> *<a href=\"http://baronsamedi.livejournal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Baron Samedi's LJ</a> -- Not 100% Scion, 100% of the time, but the Baron does occasionally post his musings on the game in general and his games in specific.<br /> *<a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Mr. Gone's Character Sheets</a> -- Many PDF sheets for Scion and all other White Wolf games.<br /> *<a href=\"http://www.emeraldsamurai.com/pages/scion_resources/\" target=\"_blank\">Emerald Samurai Resources</a> -- Lots of different PDF reference sheets and character sheets; this link goes directly to the Scion section.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":235,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","user":"Telgar","date":". 09-16-2014, 06:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T22:25:45-07:00","id":1540,"title":"","content":"can some admin sticky this and the other one?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Games are a way for us to explore what it means to be human, or inhuman, as the case may be. Let's all have a good time playing them.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/400-guitarsniper","name":"guitarsniper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T06:54:17-08:00","id":5036,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bDwlaPbAKMS07ImdToIVE0F90i12uDQOWzDDsD2ZD6c/edit?authkey=CO7Oh-4E&amp;authkey=CO7Oh-4E\" target=\"_blank\">Knacks collection</a> I gathered from various sites and <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/17zkP_jt0fGgpBcmYgFTVR2cC1gEkO_S0qZiaYFm40Po/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Birthright Ideas</a> Brent gathered from various users.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">At the end of the day, what works in <b>YOUR</b> story with <b>YOUR</b> players is what matters most. Not what someone on some forum says.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32